WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.250
On a doubtful morning, the basket is full, and the washing goes out.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.390
Everyone in the street has the same forecast.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:13.260
A doctoral thesis from the School of Emergent Priorities asks what that forecast does to the line.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.014
For two years, we walked the back lanes of one suburban district,

00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:20.908
and wrote down what every line was carrying.

00:00:21.808 --> 00:00:23.208
Three hundred and twelve lines:

00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:27.048
a hundred and eighty-one thousand, seven hundred and forty-six observations.

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:30.618
On dry mornings, the forecast didn't move the lines.

00:00:30.918 --> 00:00:36.248
Whatever it said, between forty-six and forty-eight per cent of households pegged out.

00:00:37.148 --> 00:00:40.528
Fifty-eight households also kept a card for every load they washed.

00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:46.588
Of one thousand, eight hundred and sixty-four loads pegged out, the forecast was checked first for four hundred and twelve.

00:00:46.888 --> 00:00:49.548
Checking first changed the decision thirty-seven times.

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:54.070
Three loads in four came from a full or overflowing basket.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.650
The forecast has a use, and the use comes afterwards.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.710
When the rain came,

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:05.090
seventy-six point six per cent of loads that fit in one armful were inside within four minutes.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:08.960
For loads larger than an armful, it was seventeen point eight per cent.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.228
The School has now adopted the Armful Rule.

00:01:12.628 --> 00:01:15.858
No unit of the School shall have in the field, at any one time,

00:01:16.058 --> 00:01:21.998
more commitments than its convenor can bring in alone, in one trip, within four minutes of first drops.

00:01:22.998 --> 00:01:25.358
What protects the washing isn't the forecast.

00:01:25.658 --> 00:01:29.228
It's somebody at home, and a load small enough to carry in at once.
